the loaded image preserved\"\n672-    (let [vm (run-segment (worked-segment))\n673-          vm' (vm/reset vm)]\n674-      (is (= {:segment seg, :pc 0} (vm/control vm')))\n675-      (is (not (vm/halted? vm')))\n676-      (is (= 11 (vm/value (vm/run vm'))))\n677-      (is (= (:code vm) (:code vm'))))))\n678-\n679-\n680-;; =============================================================================\n681-;; Blocking on a stream and waking\n682-;; =============================================================================\n683-\n684-(deftest blocked-stream-next-wakes-test\n685-  (let [vm (make-vm {:make-stream tu/make-stream, :capability-secret tu/secret})\n686-        program (assemble (segment 4)\n687-                          (instruction 0 :stream-make :yin.code/buffer 8)\n688-                          (instruction 1 :stream-cursor)\n689-                          (instruction 2 :stream-next)\n690-                          (instruction 3 :halt))\n691-        v (semantic/vm-load-program vm program vm/semantic-contract)\n692-        blocked (vm/run v)]\n693-    (testing \"A next on an empty stream parks in the wait set\"\n694-      (is (vm/blocked? blocked))\nCompleted-GMT: 2026-10-15 09:21:07 GMT\nCompleted-Local: 2026-10-15 16:21:07 +07\nCoding-Agent: codex\nSession-ID: unavailable (not exposed by this runtime)\n\n# 8f-3 fix round 1: Architect P3 items 1–5\n\nImplemented only the five requested fixes on top of the existing uncommitted tree.\n\n## Exact incremental diff\n\nCounts below compare against a byte snapshot taken before this task's edits, not HEAD's larger 8f-3 diff.\n\n| File | Added | Removed | Change |\n|---|---:|---:|---|\n| `src/cljc/yin/vm.cljc` | 1 | 1 | `loaded-code-floor` docstring names `semantic-register/load-ast` for projected AST batches and `semantic-register/load-vector` for canonical vectors. |\n| `src/cljc/yin/vm/ucf.cljc` | 1 | 0 | Restored `code-address` docstring: “The dao.jing segment address of a canonical vector. UCF mints no second